| description = These swamp loving creatures would like no more than to be left alone but the Trolls of [[Grobb]] will have no such thing. Deep within the ancient Trollish city of Guk, which the Frogloks reclaimed from the Innothule, they fight a never ending battle against legions of Trolls and other humanoids of ill morals who, in their quests for lost riches, seem intent on exterminating every living [[Froglok]]. The lower reaches of Guk are infested by the [[Undead Frogloks of Guk]] whom the living Frogloks hate.

The Frogloks are also cursed by the fact that it is only within the swampland of the Innothule where they can deposit and hatch their young. Few Froglok Tadpoles can avoid the ever-stomping Trollish boots long enough to reach adulthood.

